, "messageID": "msg_cfa8ff26e00177bakAtFMkhIsX", "type": "text", "text": "已有研究表明，SETDB1是一种重要的组蛋白赖氨酸甲基转移酶，主要通过催化组蛋白H3K9me3参与异染色质形成、基因转录沉默及基因组稳定性维持等关键生物学过程。我在使用Promega公司出品的MTase-Glo通用型甲基转移酶检测系统检测SETDB1酶活性时，发现多次实验中酶活性数据偏差大，结果不稳定。已知多次实验中用的SETDB1蛋白和底物（全长组蛋白H3）均是同一批纯化所得，在不更换蛋白和底物、不质疑试剂盒有效性的前提下，给出实验方案建议，以保证酶活性检测数据的稳定性。\n"}]}, {"id": "msg_cfa8ff2a3001rVORxfiSDI9W7p", "info": {"id": "msg_cfa8ff2a3001rVORxfiSDI9W7p", "sessionID": "ses_305700dabffefKSQLBo7BCFh3A", "role": "assistant", "time": {"created": 1773730263715, "completed": 1773730285665}, "parentID": "msg_cfa8ff26e00177bakAtFMkhIsX", "modelID": "Qwen 3.5 397B A17B", "providerID": "sii-holos", "mode": "synergy", "agent": "synergy", "path": {"cwd": "/inspire/hdd/project/multi-agent/niexiaohang-25130061/holos-synergy/benchmark/workspaces/onemillion/natural_science__8479__cn/omb-batch", "root": "/inspire/hdd/project/multi-agent/niexiaohang-25130061/holos-synergy/benchmark/workspaces/onemillion/natural_science__8479__cn/omb-batch"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"input": 25800, "output": 348, "reasoning": 0, "cache": {"read": 0, "write": 0}}, "finish": "tool-calls"}, "parts": [{"id": "prt_cfa8ff9b4001aFiYqVIhBtfRLJ", "sessionID": "ses_305700dabffefKSQLBo7BCFh3A", "messageID": "msg_cfa8ff2a3001rVORxfiSDI9W7p", "type": "step-start", "snapshot": "4b825dc642cb6eb9a060e54bf8d69288fbee4904"}, {"id": "prt_cfa8ff9b5001NdVSksb1jtL4NY", "sessionID": "ses_305700dabffefKSQLBo7BCFh3A", "messageID": "msg_cfa8ff2a3001rVORxfiSDI9W7p", "type": "reasoning", "text": "用户遇到了一个具体的生物化学实验问题：使用 Promega 的 MTase-Glo 试剂盒检测 SETDB1 甲基转移酶活性时，数据不稳定、偏差大。\n\n约束条件：\n1. 不更换蛋白和底物（同一批纯化的 SETDB1 和 H3）\n2. 不质疑试剂盒有效性\n3. 需要给出实验方案建议来保证数据稳定性\n\n这是一个实验技术问题，我需要搜索相关的：\n1. MTase-Glo 试剂盒的官方操作手册和注意事项\n2. SETDB1 酶活性检测的文献方法\n3. 甲基转移酶检测的常见问题和解决方案\n\n让我先搜索相关信息。", "time": {"start": 1773730265525, "end": 1773730281648}}, {"id": "prt_cfa900abc001eqDH36qf4MI7gj", "sessionID": "ses_305700dabffefKSQLBo7BCFh3A", "messageID": "msg_cfa8ff2a3001rVORxfiSDI9W7p", "type": "text", "text": "\n\n我来