 in a subsidiary. The matter has been agreed upon by 3 of the shareholders.\n(3) The target company used approximately 1,350 cubic meters of water in the past three months;\n(4) The target company distributes profits quarterly, semi-annually, or annually, and distributes profits within 90 days after the profit distribution resolution is made.\n(5) The target company's license for the use of assembled equipment is currently pending. The company will enter commercial operation on December 1, 2025.\n(6) The target company currently operates a photovoltaic power station and obtained the permit for power engineering activities on May 1, 2024.\nConcise language, clear logic, and accurate citation of laws and regulations are required.\"\n"}]}, {"id": "msg_cfa922f650018hrmzcJYK8aonT", "info": {"id": "msg_cfa922f650018hrmzcJYK8aonT", "sessionID": "ses_3056dd0deffeiav1N8O8VwXFQ3", "role": "assistant", "time": {"created": 1773730410341, "completed": 1773730453917}, "parentID": "msg_cfa922f350019n4C95qIaNlmc7", "modelID": "Qwen 3.5 397B A17B", "providerID": "sii-holos", "mode": "synergy", "agent": "synergy", "path": {"cwd": "/inspire/hdd/project/multi-agent/niexiaohang-25130061/holos-synergy/benchmark/workspaces/onemillion/law__9788__global/omb-batch", "root": "/inspire/hdd/project/multi-agent/niexiaohang-25130061/holos-synergy/benchmark/workspaces/onemillion/law__9788__global/omb-batch"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"input": 26006, "output": 446, "reasoning": 0, "cache": {"read": 0, "write": 0}}, "finish": "tool-calls"}, "parts": [{"id": "prt_cfa9254e7001o2cvOb96l7lgSX", "sessionID": "ses_3056dd0deffeiav1N8O8VwXFQ3", "messageID": "msg_cfa922f650018hrmzcJYK8aonT", "type": "step-start", "snapshot": "4b825dc642cb6eb9a060e54bf8d69288fbee4904"}, {"id": "prt_cfa9254e7002ju78TzllCErNTw", "sessionID": "ses_3056dd0deffeiav1N8O8VwXFQ3", "messageID": "msg_cfa922f650018hrmzcJYK8aonT", "type": "reasoning", "text": "This is a legal due diligence task for a Chinese investment institution looking to invest in an Uzbek target company. I need to analyze 6 specific issues under Uzbek law and identify legal risks with mitigation suggestions.\n\nLet me break down the issues:\n1. Capital reduction provisions in establishment documents\n2. Shareholder approval for subsidiary investment (3 of 5 shareholders agreed)\n3. Water usage (1,350 cubic meters in 3 months)\n4. Profit distribution timing (quarterly/semi-annually/annually, within 90 days)\n5. Equipment license pending, commercial operation scheduled for December 1, 2025\n6. Photovoltaic power station operation, power engineering permit obtained May 1, 2024\n\nI need to research Uzbek law on:\n- Company law (JSC/LLC provisions on capital, shareholder decisions, profit distribution)\n- Environmental/water usage regulations\n- Energy sector licensing requirements\n- Foreign investment regulations\n\nLet me search for relevant Uzbek legal frameworks.", "time": {"start": 1773730419943, "end": 1773730453850}}, {"id": "prt_cfa927e02001WsUyr2YW7wxSBk", "sessionID": "ses_3056dd0deffeiav1N8O8VwXFQ3", "messageID": "msg_cfa922f650018hrmzcJYK8aonT", "type": "text", "text": "\n\nI'll conduct legal research on Uzbek law relevant to this due diligence matter. Let me search for the applicable legal frameworks.", "time": {"start": 1773730453850, "end": 1773730453850}}, {"id": "prt_cfa929064001STDFlzW6WK0w69", "sessionID": "ses_3056dd0deffeiav1N8O8VwXFQ3", "messageID": "msg_cfa922f650018hrmzcJYK8aonT", "type": "tool", "callID": "call_cb5f2cd48085471597862cac", "tool": "websearch", "state": {"status": "error", "input": {"query": "Uzbekistan Company Law 2023 registered capital reduction shareholder decisions", "numResults": 10}, "error": "Error: Unable to connect. Is the computer able to access the url?", "time": {"start": 1773730436017, "end": 1773730436159}}}, {"id": "prt_cfa92947b0010wat6l686oknG8", "sessionID": "ses_3056dd0deffeiav1N8O8VwXFQ3", "messageID": "msg_cfa922f650018hrmzcJYK8aonT", "type": "tool", "callID": "call_1dd5d1