d rate hikes", "prompt": "## Task\nResearch and identify:\n1. When the Bank of Japan (BOJ) ended Yield Curve Control (YCC)\n2. All BOJ policy rate hike episodes since ending YCC (through December 2025)\n3. For each hike: the exact announcement date, the rate change (from/to), and any forward guidance\n\n## Context\nThis is for analyzing asset performance during BOJ tightening cycles. Need precise dates to calculate T-1 (prior trading day close) and T+7 (7th calendar day after announcement, excluding announcement day) performance windows.\n\n## Requirements\n- Find the exact date BOJ ended YCC\n- List all rate hikes since then with announcement dates\n- Include the March 2024 hike (first rate hike in 17 years) and any subsequent hikes\n- Search for information about the expected December 19, 2025 hike to 0.75%\n\n## Sources to check\n- BOJ official announcements\n- Financial news (Reuters, Bloomberg, FT)\n- Central bank policy trackers\n\n## Success Criteria\n- Complete list of BOJ rate hike dates since YCC ended\n- Clear timeline from YCC end through December 2025 expected hike", "subagent_type": "scout"}, "output": "Background task launched.\n\nTask ID: ctx_mmu9hzjv00003GG1\nSession ID: ses_3056870c4ffeanp1fQxcVsuRo2\nDescription: Research BOJ YCC and rate hikes\nAgent: scout\nStatus: running\n\nYou will be notified when the task completes.\nUse `task_output(task_id=\"ctx_mmu9hzjv00003GG1\")` to check progress or retrieve results.", "title": "[Background] Research BOJ YCC and rate hikes", "metadata": {"taskId": "ctx_mmu9hzjv00003GG1", "sessionId": "ses_3056870c4ffeanp1fQxcVsuRo2", "background": true, "summary": [], "truncated": false}, "time": {"start": 1773730762553, "end": 1773730762558}}}, {"id": "prt_cfa978f6f001kNS5Z1HuZQc9P9", "sessionID": "ses_305690a9dffeaAOJ6rrRX0Zsbu", "messageID": "msg_cfa973bf30016ObsCtPJ3NAWzA", "type": "step-finish", "reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "4b825dc642cb6eb9a060e54bf8d69288fbee4904", "cost": 0, "tokens": {"input": 27097, "