or each index\n2. Exact T+7 date and closing value for each index\n3. Calculated return percentage\n\n**Example calculation:**\n- For March 19, 2024 announcement:\n  - T-1 = March 18, 2024 (prior trading day)\n  - T+7 = March 27, 2024 (7 calendar days after March 19, excluding March 19)\n\n**Sources to check:**\n- Yahoo Finance historical data\n- TradingView\n- Investing.com\n- Official exchange data\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n- Complete table with T-1 date/value, T+7 date/value, and % return for all 4 indices across all 4 hike episodes", "subagent_type": "scout"}, "output": "Background task launched.\n\nTask ID: ctx_mmu9l1ee0003fqGm\nSession ID: ses_3056644a8ffex0gURnLt46Uauk\nDescription: Gather equity index data\nAgent: scout\nStatus: running\n\nYou will be notified when the task completes.\nUse `task_output(task_id=\"ctx_mmu9l1ee0003fqGm\")` to check progress or retrieve results.", "title": "[Background] Gather equity index data", "metadata": {"taskId": "ctx_mmu9l1ee0003fqGm", "sessionId": "ses_3056644a8ffex0gURnLt46Uauk", "background": true, "summary": [], "truncated": false}, "time": {"start": 1773730904917, "end": 1773730904920}}}, {"id": "prt_cfa99bc05001oejch5UcwNrrQw", "sessionID": "ses_305690a9dffeaAOJ6rrRX0Zsbu", "messageID": "msg_cfa99929b001cSi4MRvZLdLpdG", "type": "tool", "callID": "call_8c7d30bf1cf240edacbacebf", "tool": "task", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"background": true, "dag_node_id": "gather-fx-data", "description": "Gather FX rate data", "prompt": "## Task\nGather FX rate performance data for each BOJ rate hike episode since YCC ended (March 2024):\n\n**Hike Dates (Announcement Dates):**\n1. March 19, 2024\n2. July 31, 2024\n3. October 30, 2025\n4. December 19, 2025\n\n**FX pairs to retrieve:**\n- Offshore RMB/USD spot (USDCNH)\n- U.S. Dollar Index (DXY)\n- JPY/USD spot (USDJPY)\n\n**Measurement Convention:**\n- T-1 = Prior trading day's close BEFORE the BOJ hike announcement\n- T+7 = Close on the 7th calendar day AFTER the anno