you'll need to manually collect this data from:\n\n### **Best Available Sources:**\n\n1. **Yahoo Finance** (https://finance.yahoo.com/)\n   - Navigate to each currency pair:\n     - USDCNH=X (Offshore RMB/USD)\n     - USDJPY=X (JPY/USD) \n     - DX-Y.NYB (DXY - U.S. Dollar Index)\n\n2. **Investing.com** (https://www.investing.com/)\n   - Historical data section for each currency pair\n\n3. **TradingView** (https://www.tradingview.com/)\n   - Charting tool with historical data export\n\n4. **Bloomberg** or **Reuters** (if you have institutional access)\n\n### **Data Collection Steps:**\n\nFor each of the 4 BOJ rate hike episodes:\n\n**Hike 1: March 19, 2024**\n- T-1: March 18, 2024 (Monday)\n- T+7: March 26, 2024 (Tuesday)\n\n**Hike 2: July 31, 2024**\n- T-1: July 30, 2024 (Tuesday)\n- T+7: August 7, 2024 (Wednesday)\n\n**Hike 3: October 30, 2025**\n- T-1: October 29, 2025 (Wednesday)\n- T+7: November 6, 2025 (Thursday)\n\n**Hike 4: December 19, 2025**\n- T-1: December 18, 2025 (Thursday)\n- T+7: December 26, 2025 (Friday)\n\n### **Calculation Formula:**\nReturn (%) = [Close(T+7) - Close(T-1)] / Close(T-1) × 100%\n\n### **Expected Data Format:**\n\n| Hike Date | FX Pair | T-1 Date | T-1 Close | T+7 Date | T+7 Close | Return (%) |\n|-----------|---------|----------|-----------|----------|-----------|------------|\n| Mar 19, 2024 | USDCNH | Mar 18, 2024 | [value] | Mar 26, 2024 | [value] | [calc] |\n| Mar 19, 2024 | USDJPY | Mar 18, 2024 | [value] | Mar 26, 2024 | [value] | [calc] |\n| Mar 19, 2024 | DXY | Mar 18, 2024 | [value] | Mar 26, 2024 | [value] | [calc] |\n| ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\nIf you can provide me with the raw data points or if connectivity is restored, I can immediately calculate all the returns and format the complete table for you.", "title": "Task ctx_mmu9ldah00086V69", "metadata": {"taskId": "ctx_mmu9ldah00086V69", "status": "completed", "found": true, "description": "Gather FX rate data", "truncated": false}, "time": {"start": 