w York Market Price for the years 1791 to Present\nBritish Official Price for the years 1257 to 1945\nU.S. Official Price for the years 1786 to Present\n\n\n\n  \n  The market prices are the average of the daily prices for the year. To help understand where the historical data come from, you should read\n     \n                What Was the Price of Gold Then? Importance, Measurement, and History (25K PDF).\n    The specialist or the serious user\n    will also want to read\n    \n                What was the Price of Gold Then? A Data Study (111K PDF).\n    This essay considers the five\n    gold-price series one by one and provides a detailed description and evaluation\n    of the existing work on the specific price.\n  \n\n\n\n\n Please read our\n    \n                Note on Data Revisions.\n                \n\n\n\nCitation\n    Lawrence H. Officer and Samuel H. Williamson, &quot;The Price of Gold, 1257 - Present.,&quot;\n       MeasuringWorth, \n      URL: http://www.measuringworth.com/gold/\n\n Please let us know if and how this discussion has assisted you in using our calculators.\n\n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  MeasuringWorth is a service for calculating relative worth over time.\n    Home | About Us  |  Contact Us  |  Support Our Work\n\n    Copyright &copy; This work may be used for non-profit educational purposes if proper credit is given. For other permission, please Contact Us.", "title": "https://www.measuringworth.com/datasets/gold/ (text/html; charset=UTF-8)", "metadata": {"truncated": false}, "time": {"start": 1773730915445, "end": 1773730916381}}}, {"id": "prt_cfa99e81e001xV5B1Q5stpvZFS", "sessionID": "ses_30567e11cffeO9N7FKU68G3UC9", "messageID": "msg_cfa99a871001nhvMzTR40vs7H3", "type": "step-finish", "reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "4b825dc642cb6eb9a060e54bf8d69288fbee4904", "cost": 0, "tokens": {"input": 28999, "output": 63, "reasoning": 0, "cache": {"read": 0, "write": 0}}}]}, {"id": "msg_cfa99e8280010P3WJJzbq0F7Am", "info": {"id": "msg_cfa99e8280