ct/multi-agent/niexiaohang-25130061/holos-synergy/benchmark/workspaces/onemillion/economics_and_finance__1379__cn/omb-batch"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"input": 37040, "output": 64, "reasoning": 0, "cache": {"read": 0, "write": 0}}, "finish": "tool-calls"}, "parts": [{"id": "prt_cfa9a9a8b0015z3zZmDO9P35s8", "sessionID": "ses_30567e11cffeO9N7FKU68G3UC9", "messageID": "msg_cfa9a94e5001nTDe8brkVSVxTH", "type": "step-start", "snapshot": "4b825dc642cb6eb9a060e54bf8d69288fbee4904"}, {"id": "prt_cfa9a9b6c001Fc7MMSTpi2nMfz", "sessionID": "ses_30567e11cffeO9N7FKU68G3UC9", "messageID": "msg_cfa9a94e5001nTDe8brkVSVxTH", "type": "text", "text": "", "time": {"start": 1773730965250, "end": 1773730965250}}, {"id": "prt_cfa9aa3120014E94CntHdOhab5", "sessionID": "ses_30567e11cffeO9N7FKU68G3UC9", "messageID": "msg_cfa9a94e5001nTDe8brkVSVxTH", "type": "tool", "callID": "call_e96fa8c05a304bbcb8885a71", "tool": "webfetch", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"url": "https://www.gold.org/goldhub/data/gold-prices", "format": "markdown", "timeout": 30}, "output": "                              Gold Spot Prices & Market History | World Gold Council       \n\n[Skip to main content](#main-content)\n\n[](/)\n\nGlobal\n\n[Global](//www.gold.org) [中国](//china.gold.org) [日本](https://www.gold.org/ja/goldhub)\n\n[Data](/goldhub/data) [Research](/goldhub/research/library) [Tools](/goldhub/tools) [ESG](/goldhub/esg \"ESG\") [Events](/news-and-events/events \"Events\") [Insights](/goldhub/gold-focus \"Social commentary about gold\")\n\n[World Gold Council Gold Industry & Corporate](/) [Goldhub Professional Investors](/goldhub) [Invest.gold Individual Investors](https://invest.gold)\n\n## [Gold Spot price](https://www.gold.org/goldhub/data#price-and-premium)\n\n\\-\n\nAWAITED\n\nLast Updated Show chart\n\n## Gold spot price\n\n[Price and Premium Data](https://www.gold.org/goldhub/data#price-and-premium)\n\n-   [Goldhub](/goldhub)\n-   [Data](/goldhub/data)\n-   Gold spot prices\n\n# Gold spot prices\n\n16 March, 2026 [Price and premium](/goldhub/data#price-and-premium)\n\nPrice discovery is crucial for any market. Gold not only has a spot price, but it also has the LBMA Gold Price, as well as several regional prices. The LBMA Gold Price is used as an important benchmark throughout the gold market, while the other regional gold prices are important to local markets.\n\nThis data set provides the gold price averages over a range of timeframes (monthly, quarterly, annually) going back to 1978, and in the major trading, producer, and consumer currencies.\n\n**As of 18 March 2025, only limited LBMA Gold Price data is available on our website. Historical LBMA Gold Price data has been removed at the request of the ICE Benchmark Administration. If you would like to obtain the historical LBMA Gold Price, please visit** [**here**](https://www.ice.com/iba/lbma-gold-silver-price) **for more information on licensing.**\n\n### Downloads:\n\n-   [**Download** *xlsx* Gold price averages in a range of currencies since 1978](/download/file/8369/Gold_price_averages_in_a range_of_currencies_since_1978.xlsx)\n    \n\n \n\n## Gold prices\n\nData as of 16 March, 2026\n\nMarket Data: Provided by ICE Data Services. More information Information displayed herein may include market data provided by ICE Data Services, and/or its affiliates (“ICE Group”) and/or may be information derived from market data provided by the ICE Group (together, “ICE Data”). Market data provided by ICE Group is proprietary property of ICE Group. The ICE Data provided herein is for informational purposes only and subject to change without notice. ICE Group hereby expressly disclaim any and all representations and warranties of every kind, express and/or implied, including without limitation any warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose or use, or title as to the ICE Data. ICE Group does not guarantee the accuracy, adequacy, completeness or availability of any ICE Data and is not responsible for any errors or omissions, regardless of the cause or for the results obtained from the use of ICE Data. In no event shall ICE Group be liable for any direct, indirect, special or consequential damages, costs, expenses, legal fees, or losses (including loss income or lost profit and opportunity costs) in connection with any use of the ICE Data.   \nData Source: Copyright © 2024 FactSet Research Systems Inc. All rights reserved, Multi Commodity Exchange of India Limited\n\n \n\n## Gold reference prices\n\nData as of 16 March, 2026\n\nSources: ICE Benchmark Administration, Multi Commodity Exchange of India Limited, Shanghai Gold Exchange, World Gold Council; [Disclaimer](https://www.gold.org/terms-and-conditions#proprietary-rights)\n\n### Length and Frequency\n\nThe average gold price in a range of frequencies (monthly, quarterly, annually) and various currencies (including the major trading, producer, and consumer currencies) from 1978. Gold reference prices from the London Bullion Market Association and Shanghai Gold Exchange in a range of frequencies (daily, weekly, monthly, annually) back to 2015 or earlier where available.\n\n### Update Schedule\n\nUpdated weekly.\n\n### Units\n\nPrices are quoted in currency unit per troy ounce unless otherwise stated.\n\n### Methodologies\n\n[LBMA Gold Price](https://www.ice.com/iba/lbma-precious-metals)\n\n### Related Downloads:\n\n-   [**Download** *pdf* Historical Pricing Methodology](/download/file/12490/historical_pricing_methodology.pdf)\n    \n\n[BACK TO TOP](#)\n\n### Receive the newest data and research in your inbox\n\nHelping you stay informed about the gold industry’s latest news and updates.\n\n[SIGN UP](javascript:website.user.login_form\\(\\))\n\n##### Follow us\n\n[](https://twitter.com/GOLDCOUNCIL \"Follow us on X\")[](https://www.facebook.com/worldgoldcouncil/ \"Follow us on Facebook\")[](https://www.linkedin.com/company/world-gold-council/ \"Follow us on LinkedIn\")[](https://www.tiktok.com/@thestoryofgold \"Follow us on TikTok\")[](https://www.instagram.com/thestoryofgold/ \"Follow us on Instagram\")[](https://www.youtube.com/@worldgoldcouncil \"Follow us on YouTube\")\n\n[](/)\n\n##### Goldhub\n\n[Data](/goldhub/data) [Research](/goldhub/research/library) [Tools](/goldhub/tools) [ESG](/goldhub/esg \"ESG\") [Events](/news-and-events/events \"Events\") [Insights](/goldhub/gold-focus \"Social commentary about gold\")\n\n##### Values\n\n[Accessibility](/accessibility) [COVID-19 statement](/world-gold-council-covid-19-statement) [Human Rights Statement](/world-gold-council-human-rights-statement) [Modern Slavery Statement](/modern-slavery-statement) [Expectations of Suppliers](/expectations-of-suppliers) [Women's Empowerment and Gender Equality](/womens-empowerment-and-gender-equality)\n\n##### Legal\n\n[Manage Cookies](#manage-cookies) [Cookies Policy](/cookies) [Privacy](/privacy-policy) [Applicant Privacy Notice](/applicantprivacynotice) [Terms & Conditions](/terms-and-conditions)\n\n### Join our Focus Group\n\nWe value your opinion, we would like to hear from professional investors like yourself.\n\nSign up now  \nAsk me later\n\nWe value your opinion - The World Gold Council would like to contact professional investors like yourself to participate in focus groups, surveys and share your feedback on the World Gold Council website experience.\n\n[Contact us](/contact-us) [Sitemap](/sitemap) [Our Offices](/about-us/our-offices) [当社のオフィス](/ja/page/18632)\n\n[沪ICP备16026324号-1](http://beian.miit.gov.cn/) [公安备案号31010602004116](http://www.beian.gov.cn/portal/registerSystemInfo) ©2026 World Gold Council. All Rights Reserved\n\n使用微信扫一扫登录  \n\\[世界黄金协会\\]  \n![](/themes/custom/wgc_v01/img/wechatqr.png)\n\n×", "title": "https://www.gold.org/goldhub/data/gold-prices (text/html; charset=UTF-8)", "metadata": {"truncated": false}, "time": {"start": 1773730965194, "end": 1773730965468}}}, {"id": "prt_cfa9aa7dc001ewUD1MzOkefz1O", "sessionID": "ses_30567e11cffeO9N7FKU68G3UC9", "messa