25/250508_3e.pdf\n\nPlease use webfetch to download these PDFs and extract the following critical data points:\n\n1. **Hardware/Software Sales:**\n   - Nintendo Switch hardware sales volume for FY2024 and FY2025\n   - Nintendo Switch software sales volume for FY2024 and FY2025\n   - Calculate Software Attach Rate (Software/Hardware) for both years\n\n2. **Operating Profit & FX Impact:**\n   - Total Operating Profit for FY2024 and FY2025 (in ¥100 million units)\n   - In the waterfall chart showing factors affecting operating profit changes, find the specific FX (foreign exchange) impact amount\n   - Calculate operating profit growth rate excluding FX impact\n\n3. **Digital Revenue:**\n   - Digital sales revenue and proportion to total dedicated video game platform software revenue\n   - Nintendo Switch Online (NSO) membership numbers and growth\n   - Add-on content revenue growth\n\n4. **R&D and Inventory:**\n   - R&D expenses for FY2024 and FY2025\n   - Ending balance of raw materials and inventories\n   - Calculate Inventory Turnover Days changes\n\nIMPORTANT: Keep all amounts in ¥100 million (hundred-million-yen) units - do NOT convert to USD.\n\nReturn all extracted data with specific page references where you found each number.", "subagent_type": "scout"}, "output": "Background task launched.\n\nTask ID: ctx_mmu9nogo00008mM8\nSession ID: ses_305646367ffedR5zVdNhgZVwzr\nDescription: Extract FY2025 Nintendo financial data\nAgent: scout\nStatus: running\n\nYou will be notified when the task completes.\nUse `task_output(task_id=\"ctx_mmu9nogo00008mM8\")` to check progress or retrieve results.", "title": "[Background] Extract FY2025 Nintendo financial data", "metadata": {"taskId": "ctx_mmu9nogo00008mM8", "sessionId": "ses_305646367ffedR5zVdNhgZVwzr", "background": true, "summary": [], "truncated": false}, "time": {"start": 1773731028118, "end": 1773731028123}}}, {"id": "prt_cfa9b9cd5001dmelXIwHE7YDKz", "sessionID": "ses_305675438ffecYfB3l74idZvhs", "messageID": "msg_